# Supplement to E540: recipe-local PATH and a missing archiver; E012 already covers LLVM ar configuration.
id: DRAFT-libncursesw-6.6-build-path-archiver
draft: true
contributor_id: Windrel
title: OHOS native builds can compile with absolute-path Clang yet fail at static archiving when recipe PATH and profile omit ar

trigger_tool: make
phase: compilation
error_signature: (?m)^ar unknown \.\./lib/libncursesw\.a[^\n]*\nmake\[1\]: ar: No such file or directory
severity: 3
category: toolchain, conan, build-system
match_keywords: libncursesw, GNU make, llvm-ar, ar, static archive, PATH, VirtualBuildEnv, CONFIG_SHELL, OHOS, HarmonyBrew

root_cause: The native OHOS profile provided absolute Clang paths but no executable ar in the effective recipe build environment, so C compilation succeeded and the first static archive target failed; recipe-local PATH replacement can additionally hide caller-provided tool directories, while the preflight list did not inspect ar.
affected_scope: Verified for libncursesw/6.6_p20260516 on an arm64 HarmonyOS device using Conan 2.29.1, Clang 15.0.4, HarmonyBrew SDK 26.0.0.18_2, GNU make 4.4.1, and a device-local profile; other CI workers and recipes have not been run with this profile.
verification_cmd: sh "$HOME/bin/run-ohos-shadow-ci.sh" archives/l/libncursesw/6.6_p20260516 --repo "$HOME/ohos-users/device-b/libncursesw-f531e409" --try-lock

rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: preserve-build-path-and-declare-archiver
rec_description: Preserve the caller PATH when composing AutotoolsToolchain and VirtualBuildEnv; select an executable Bash for configure, and configure AR/RANLIB to the target SDK LLVM tools in the device profile before native make. Check archiver resolution inside the effective build environment rather than treating compiler success or an incomplete tool preflight as sufficient.
rec_command:
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual

fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach:
fallback_description:
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl:

forbid_1_pattern: treat OHOS_BUILD_TOOLS=8/8 or successful Clang compilation as proof that ar is available
forbid_1_reason: The eight-tool preflight did not include ar and the compiler was resolved from a separate absolute path.
forbid_1_consequence: make[1] fails at libncursesw.a with ar: No such file or directory and Error 127.

principles:
causes:
caused_by:
similar_to: E540, E012
conflicts_with:
prerequisite_of:

